  "releaseNotes": "Refactored source generator internals to a clear Analyze → Validate → Emit flow.\n\n      Centralized diagnostics: discovery is now facts-only; all diagnostics are produced during validation.\n\n      Hardened middleware validation:\n\n      Middleware types must be open generic definitions.\n\n      Only arity 1 or 2 supported.\n\n      Context-closed middleware (arity 1) must match the expected context.\n\n      Improved reliability by removing fragile metadata-name middleware resolution.\n\n      Added/expanded unit tests covering new validation rules.\n\n      No breaking API changes.",
